      "content": "Thanks for this. It's accurate, but the 'Rigorousness Metric' score came back quite low—it's only flagging two citations. The partner is actually quite particular about seeing a more robust legal foundation in these summaries to feel confident in the analysis.\n\nCould you expand the summary slightly? Try to integrate some additional relevant authorities or related cases that support the court's reasoning regarding the scope of 'necessity' or the limits of statutory authorization. Again, just make sure they actually relate to the legal logic here; I don't want a list of random cases, just a more thorough legal context.",
